sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant Client as React SPA
    participant Backend as FastAPI Auth Router
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant OAuth as Google / GitHub OAuth

    Note over User,DB: Scenario 1: Standard Email & Password Registration / Login
    User->>Client: Enter Email & Password
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/register or /auth/login
    Backend->>Backend: Hash Password with bcrypt (salt rounds: 12)
    alt Registration Flow
        Backend->>DB: INSERT INTO users (role="USER", is_active=True)
        Backend->>DB: INSERT INTO profiles & wallets (balance=5)
    else Login Flow
        Backend->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
        Backend->>Backend: Verify bcrypt password & check is_active == True
    end
    Backend->>Backend: Issue HS256 JWT Token (sub=user_id, role=role, exp=24h)
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (access_token, user_payload)
    Client->>Client: Store token in memory/Zustand & set Authorization Header

    Note over User,OAuth: Scenario 2: OAuth2 Login / Registration Flow
    User->>Client: Click "Sign in with Google / GitHub"
    Client->>Backend: GET /auth/oauth/authorize?provider=google
    Backend-->>Client: Redirect to OAuth Provider + state token
    Client->>OAuth: User authorizes SkillSwap Arena
    OAuth-->>Client: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=...&state=...
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/oauth/callback (code, state)
    Backend->>OAuth: Exchange code for Access Token & Profile (email, sub, name)
    Backend->>DB: Find existing user or create linked account
    Backend->>Backend: Issue SkillSwap JWT Session Token
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (access_token, user_payload)
    Client-->>User: Navigate to /dashboard
